  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Brassica is different from restaurant chains that publish fixed calorie and macro values for every menu item.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The restaurant uses locally sourced, seasonal, and artisan ingredients in made-from-scratch recipes. Because ingredients and recipes can change throughout the year,\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Brassica does not currently publish complete tested calorie and nutrition information for its menu\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That means an exact calorie number for a Brassica sandwich or salad should not be presented as verified unless it comes from current restaurant testing or another clearly identified reliable source.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.71cfq1ppqiiq\">\n<span>\n     How a Brassica Meal Is Built\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Brassica's menu centers on customizable\n    </span>\n<span>\n     sandwiches and salads\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , allowing you to combine several ingredients into one meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A typical order can include:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Base:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     organic whole wheat pita or greens\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     options such as chicken, beef, or falafel\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spreads:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     hummus, baba, and similar components\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Vegetables:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     cabbage, cucumbers, radishes, cauliflower, eggplant, beets, carrots, and other seasonal choices\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauces:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     tahini, roasted red pepper sauce, z'hug, and other house sauces\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Because each combination is different, two Brassica orders can have very different nutrition profiles even when they are both described simply as a salad or sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.py197l1sp4p0\">\n<span>\n     Why Brassica Calories Are Difficult to Calculate Exactly\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Many restaurant nutrition calculators rely on standardized recipes that remain almost identical across every location.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Brassica operates differently.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The restaurant says its local and seasonal sourcing requires frequent changes to ingredients, recipes, and producers. According to Brassica, accurately publishing complete nutrition information would therefore require repeated nutritional testing whenever those recipes change.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For that reason, any third-party\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Brassica calorie calculator should clearly distinguish between verified nutrition data and estimates\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.cadsezbygw0j\">\n<span>\n     Sandwich vs Salad\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Choosing a sandwich or salad changes the foundation of the meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A sandwich includes Brassica's organic whole wheat pita, while a salad uses greens as the base. From there, proteins, spreads, vegetables, sauces, and additional ingredients determine the rest of the meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The pita therefore should not be treated as nutritionally equivalent to a salad base.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Likewise, adding hummus, falafel, meat, fries, tahini, or another sauce changes the final meal beyond the base alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.y9ihrguk2bzo\">\n<span>\n     Do Sauces and Extras Matter?\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Yes.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Ingredients such as hummus, tahini-based sauces, fries, falafel, and other additions contribute their own calories and nutrients.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Brassica also offers separate menu items such as\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Brassica Fries, Brassarita, and a Tahini Chocolate Chip Cookie\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , which should be treated separately from the sandwich or salad if nutrition information becomes available.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.qhegq0e6b6rd\">\n<span>\n     Brassica Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Brassica publish calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Why does Brassica not provide full nutrition facts?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Can I calculate calories in a custom Brassica salad?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is a Brassica salad automatically lower in calories than a sandwich?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.8k0qdynuoo4w\">\n<span>\n     Nutrition Data Availability\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver should only display Brassica calorie and macro values when they can be supported by a reliable source.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Until verified nutrition values are available, unavailable nutrients should be marked\n    </span>\n<span>\n     \u201cNot available\u201d\n    </span>\n<span>\n     rather than displayed as zero.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Does Brassica publish calories?",
      "a": "Brassica currently states that it has\n    \n\n     not completed nutritional testing for its menu items\n    \n\n     , so complete official calorie and macro values are not available."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why does Brassica not provide full nutrition facts?",
      "a": "The restaurant explains that its use of local, organic, artisan, and seasonal ingredients leads to frequent recipe and supplier changes, making fixed nutrition testing difficult to keep accurate."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I calculate calories in a custom Brassica salad?",
      "a": "An estimate may be possible if reliable nutrition data exists for each exact ingredient and portion, but it should not be presented as official Brassica nutrition data."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is a Brassica salad automatically lower in calories than a sandwich?",
      "a": "Not necessarily. The final total depends on the protein, hummus, vegetables, sauces, toppings, and portions added to the meal."
    }
  ]
